    "formal": "\\forall b\\ d\\ n,\\ 2\\le b\\land 0<d\\land b\\equiv 1\\pmod d\\Rightarrow (d\\mid n\\leftrightarrow d\\mid \\operatorname{digitSum}_b(n)), with base-10 divisibility by 3/9 and digital-root corollaries.",
    "plain": "Backfill the divisibility-rule metadata around digit-sum tests in arbitrary bases, concrete base-10 rules for 3 and 9, hex/octal specializations, and digital-root arithmetic.",
