      "Digit-sum divisibility rules are elementary number-theory facts with reusable modular-arithmetic structure.",
      "The generalized base/modulus theorem explains why the familiar tests for 3 and 9 work.",
      "The digital-root files package the same congruence idea into computable arithmetic checks."
    ]
  },
