      "`divisibility_by_3` and `divisibility_by_9` prove the base-10 digit-sum rules.",
      "`modEq_digits_sum_general` and `dvd_iff_dvd_digits_sum_general` give the general theorem when `b % d = 1`.",
      "`hex_div_15`, `hex_div_3`, `hex_div_5`, and `oct_div_7` instantiate the rule for hexadecimal and octal bases.",
      "`digitalRootFormula`, `digitalRoot_mod9`, `digitalRoot_div3`, `digitalRoot_add`, and `digitalRoot_mul` formalize digital-root behavior."
